\r\n\r\n#bin-character img {\r\n  position: absolute;\r\n  inset: 0;\r\n  width: 100%;\r\n  height: 100%;\r\n \n<truncated 22336 bytes>\nw_1787730327041.jpg\nLast Edited: 2026-08-26T07:45:27Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: scissors_art_1787728090348]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/scissors_art_1787728090348.jpg\nLast Edited: 2026-08-26T07:08:10Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: shirt_soft_1787719072757]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/shirt_soft_1787719072757.jpg\nLast Edited: 2026-08-26T04:37:52Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: shoes_velcro_1787719241323]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/shoes_velcro_1787719241323.jpg\nLast Edited: 2026-08-26T04:40:41Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: sunhat_art_1787728202413]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/sunhat_art_1787728202413.jpg\nLast Edited: 2026-08-26T07:10:02Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: teddy_bear_1787718486091]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/teddy_bear_1787718486091.jpg\nLast Edited: 2026-08-26T04:28:06Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: toothbrush_art_1787728171056]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/toothbrush_art_1787728171056.jpg\nLast Edited: 2026-08-26T07:09:31Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: walkthrough]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/walkthrough.md\nLast Edited: 2026-08-26T04:34:15Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: water_bottle_large_1787728123998]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/water_bottle_large_1787728123998.jpg\nLast Edited: 2026-08-26T07:08:44Z\n\n# Conversation Logs\n\nReference the following log files for the full, untruncated conversation:\n\n- C:\\Users\\USER\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6\\.system_generated\\logs\\transcript.jsonl\n\n*